---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: "SELECT t.a FROM t JOIN (SELECT a, count(*) AS n FROM u GROUP BY a) g ON t.a <=> g.a WHERE t.b = 'x'"
---
Project [a#0]
+- Join Inner, (a#0 <=> a#3)
   :- Aggregate [a#3], [a#3]
   :  +- Scan spark_catalog.default.u [a#3]
   +- Project [a#0]
      +- Filter (b#1 == 'x')
         +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0, b#1]
